          "These verbs conjugate like any other: \"ho parcato il carro\" meant \"ho parcheggiato la macchina\". Forms and spellings varied from one community to another and were never fixed, so treat any list of them as approximate. Similar forms, such as \"checkare\", have arisen independently in the slang of young Italians in Italy, but they remain informal and are out of place in careful speech or writing.",
